 This install applies to "Rescue on Fractalus!", an unofficial Amiga port of
 the 1985 Atari 8-bit game by the Lucasfilm Games Division.

 Requirements:
 -------------
 This install requires WHDLoad version 16.0 or better to be in the path. It
 can be found in the WHDLoad package.
 Nothing has to be copied from an original disk, the game ships in this
 archive.

 The installed program requires 384 KB ChipMem and 832 KB OtherMem. PAL only.
 It can be quit by pressing the left mouse button, immediately and without
 confirmation, at any point in the game. The WHDLoad QuitKey (F10, key can be
 changed with Tooltype "QuitKey=") works only on a 68010 or better.

 The game requires an installed A500 Kickstart 1.3 image.
 The kickstart image must be located in the directory "Devs:Kickstarts" and
 must be named "kick34005.A500". The image can be extracted from an A500 with
 tools like 'GrabKick' or similar which can be found on aminet.
 If the image is of wrong version or altered in any way WHDLoad will quit with
 an appropriate message.
 Additionally the file "kick34005.A500.RTB" must be installed in the same
 directory as the kickstart image. It can be found in the archive
 "util/boot/skick346.lha" on aminet.


